      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's an interesting breakdown. I noticed you put Arjun at the bottom of the list despite him coming from Stanford and doing high-level tech consulting. You mentioned his background might not \"resonate\" or that he's less \"connected\" to the traditional setting. \n\nCould you expand on that? When you're assessing \"executive gravitas\" or \"cultural fit\" for these types of older, more conservative boards, what specific traits or characteristics are you looking for that Arjun might be lacking compared to someone like Julian?",
